('bb2f0886-0c3c-57c7-98ce-2ca7e1c65d0e'::uuid,'est','"Coordinate Geometry, Circles & Conics"'::jsonb,'medium','mcq','"The horizontal line in the graph shows the distance between a fixed point and an object as a function of elapsed time. The object could be doing which of the following?\nI. Moving in a circle around the fixed point\nII. Moving in a straight line away from the fixed point\nIII. Standing still\n[Figure: distance vs. time graph; the graph is a horizontal ray starting above the origin.]"'::jsonb,'[{"key":"F","text":"I only"},{"key":"G","text":"II only"},{"key":"H","text":"III only"},{"key":"J","text":"I and II only"},{"key":"K","text":"I and III only"}]'::jsonb,'{"source":"Kimi Agent Math PDF Question Bank (4)","source_file":"book_t1.md","source_sha256":"eef682d7d604550f5b03d4515fc8ad2b38118fd3a6267cd26237107865237ce6","source_question_id":"T1-05","import_batch":"est2-kimi-bank-2026-09-21","curriculum_lesson":"Coordinate Geometry, Circles & Conics","image":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xxx64220-debug/ghoneem-math-portal/main/assets/question-bank/T1-05.png","image_alt":"Original graph, diagram, or table for T1-05","visual_verified":true}'::jsonb,'"K"'::jsonb,'"Source-keyed answer from book_t1.md (T1-05)."'::jsonb),
